dsh-plan-access-mode
==================

This package contains a modified copy of the browser client bundle from

  @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-permission-presets 0.2.2-rc.3
  Copyright (c) DeepSeek
  Licensed under the MIT License

Modifications made for this package:

  - added a `plan` entry to the permission glyph map (a 14px line
    lightbulb SVG rendered with the existing JSX runtime);
  - rendered the host-provided permission description as a small second
    line under each option label in the composer access-mode menu;
  - changed the client module id and CSS tag ids to `dsh-plan-access-mode`
    so this copy can replace the official `ui-permission` row.

